@startuml scope-setup
title US-15: Scope Setup - First-Time Operator Configures Workspace

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam participantBorderColor #555555
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #F8F8F8
skinparam noteBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

actor Operator
participant "Angular\nDashboard" as Dashboard
participant "Express API" as API
database "TimescaleDB\nusers + user_workspaces" as TSDB

== Authentication ==

Operator -> Dashboard : opens Sentinel dashboard
Dashboard -> API : GET /users/me/workspace\nAuthorization: Bearer <JWT>

note over API
  JWT is validated by Express middleware.
  user_id is extracted from the token.
end note

API -> TSDB : SELECT scope FROM user_workspaces\nWHERE user_id = $1
TSDB --> API : (no rows - first visit)

API --> Dashboard : 404 No workspace saved

Dashboard --> Operator : clean map\n+ scope setup prompt\n(no alerts yet)

== Scope Configuration ==

Operator -> Dashboard : selects region "France"\nentity types: aircraft + vessel\nalert types: SIGNAL_LOSS, COMPOSITE

note over Dashboard
  Region "France" resolves to a bounding box
  from the predefined static region list.
  { min_lat: 41.3, max_lat: 51.1,
    min_lon: -5.2, max_lon: 9.6 }
  No external geocoder required.
end note

Dashboard -> API : PUT /users/me/workspace\n{ geo_region: { name: "France", bounds: {...} },\n  entity_types: ["aircraft","vessel"],\n  alert_types: ["SIGNAL_LOSS","COMPOSITE"] }

API -> TSDB : INSERT INTO user_workspaces (user_id, scope, updated_at)\nVALUES ($1, $2, now())\nON CONFLICT (user_id) DO UPDATE SET scope = $2, updated_at = now()

TSDB --> API : updated
API --> Dashboard : 200 OK

== WebSocket Connection with Scope ==

Dashboard -> API : WebSocket upgrade\nGET /stream?token=<JWT>

API -> TSDB : SELECT scope FROM user_workspaces WHERE user_id = $1
TSDB --> API : { geo_region, entity_types, alert_types }

note over API
  Scope is loaded into the in-memory
  connection map: { connection_id -> scope }.
  All subsequent alert fan-out for this
  connection uses this scope object.
end note

API --> Dashboard : 101 Switching Protocols

Dashboard --> Operator : map highlights France region\nalert stream active\n(scoped to France, aircraft+vessel, SIGNAL_LOSS+COMPOSITE)

@enduml
